OL,3,GNEWSACare home breached safety and
OL,4,Aleadership rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FA care home found to be in breach of
OL,7,Fsafety and governance regulations has
OL,8,Fbeen told to improve by a watchdog.
OL,10,FWestwinds Residential Care in
OL,11,FWorkington - a home for 14 elderly
OL,12,Fadults - was given an overall rating of
OL,13,Frequires improvement by the Care
OL,14,FQuality Commission (CQC) after an
OL,15,Finspection in July.
OL,17,FThe report highlighted concerns over
OL,18,Fthe safe management of medicines and
OL,19,Frisk of infections spreading.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
